{"v":[{"a":["عَمَّ","يَتَسَآءَلُونَ"],"t":"What are they asking one another about","l":"Amma Yatasa'aluna","w":[["ʿamma","About what"],["yatasāalūna","are they asking one another"]]},{"a":["عَنِ","ٱلنَّبَإِ","ٱلۡعَظِيمِ"],"t":"About the Great Event","l":"Ani An-Naba'i Al-`Azimi","w":[["ʿani","About"],["l-naba-i","the News"],["l-ʿaẓīmi","the Great"]]},{"a":["ٱلَّذِي","هُمۡ","فِيهِ","مُخۡتَلِفُونَ"],"t":"About which they disagree","l":"Al-Ladhi Hum Fihi Mukhtalifuna","w":[["alladhī","(About) which"],["hum","they"],["fīhi","(are) concerning it"],["mukh'talifūna","(in) disagreement"]]},{"a":["كَلَّا","سَيَعۡلَمُونَ"],"t":"Surely, they will find out","l":"Kalla Saya`lamuna","w":[["kallā","Nay"],["sayaʿlamūna","(soon) they will know"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","كَلَّا","سَيَعۡلَمُونَ"],"t":"Most certainly, they will find out","l":"Thumma Kalla Saya`lamuna","w":[["thumma","Then"],["kallā","Nay"],["sayaʿlamūna","(soon) they will know"]]},{"a":["أَلَمۡ","نَجۡعَلِ","ٱلۡأَرۡضَ","مِهَٰدٗا"],"t":"Did We not make the earth a cradle","l":"Alam Naj`ali Al-'Arđa Mihadaan","w":[["alam","Have not"],["najʿali","We made"],["l-arḍa","the earth"],["mihādan","a resting place"]]},{"a":["وَٱلۡجِبَالَ","أَوۡتَادٗا"],"t":"And the mountains pegs","l":"Wa Al-Jibala 'Awtadaan","w":[["wal-jibāla","And the mountains"],["awtādan","(as) pegs"]]},{"a":["وَخَلَقۡنَٰكُمۡ","أَزۡوَٰجٗا"],"t":"And created you in pairs","l":"Wa Khalaqnakum 'Azwajaan","w":[["wakhalaqnākum","And We created you"],["azwājan","(in) pairs"]]},{"a":["وَجَعَلۡنَا","نَوۡمَكُمۡ","سُبَاتٗا"],"t":"And made your sleep for rest","l":"Wa Ja`alna Nawmakum Subataan","w":[["wajaʿalnā","And We made"],["nawmakum","your sleep"],["subātan","(for) rest"]]},{"a":["وَجَعَلۡنَا","ٱلَّيۡلَ","لِبَاسٗا"],"t":"And made the night a cover","l":"Wa Ja`alna Al-Layla Libasaan","w":[["wajaʿalnā","And We made"],["al-layla","the night"],["libāsan","(as) covering"]]},{"a":["وَجَعَلۡنَا","ٱلنَّهَارَ","مَعَاشٗا"],"t":"And made the day for livelihood","l":"Wa Ja`alna An-Nahara Ma`ashaan","w":[["wajaʿalnā","And We made"],["l-nahāra","the day"],["maʿāshan","(for) livelihood"]]},{"a":["وَبَنَيۡنَا","فَوۡقَكُمۡ","سَبۡعٗا","شِدَادٗا"],"t":"And built above you seven strong ones","l":"Wa Banayna Fawqakum Sab`aan Shidadaan","w":[["wabanaynā","And We constructed"],["fawqakum","over you"],["sabʿan","seven"],["shidādan","strong"]]},{"a":["وَجَعَلۡنَا","سِرَاجٗا","وَهَّاجٗا"],"t":"And placed a blazing lamp","l":"Wa Ja`alna Sirajaan Wa Hhajaan","w":[["wajaʿalnā","And We placed"],["sirājan","a lamp"],["wahhājan","burning"]]},{"a":["وَأَنزَلۡنَا","مِنَ","ٱلۡمُعۡصِرَٰتِ","مَآءٗ","ثَجَّاجٗا"],"t":"And brought down from the clouds pouring water","l":"Wa 'Anzalna Mina Al-Mu`sirati Ma'an Thajjajaan","w":[["wa-anzalnā","And We sent down"],["mina","from"],["l-muʿ'ṣirāti","the rain clouds"],["māan","water"],["thajjājan","pouring abundantly"]]},{"a":["لِّنُخۡرِجَ","بِهِۦ","حَبّٗا","وَنَبَاتٗا"],"t":"To produce with it grains and vegetation","l":"Linukhrija Bihi Habbaan Wa Nabataan","w":[["linukh'rija","That We may bring forth"],["bihi","thereby"],["ḥabban","grain"],["wanabātan","and vegetation"]]},{"a":["وَجَنَّـٰتٍ","أَلۡفَافًا"],"t":"And luxuriant gardens","l":"Wa Jannatin 'Alfafaan","w":[["wajannātin","And gardens"],["alfāfan","(of) thick foliage"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","يَوۡمَ","ٱلۡفَصۡلِ","كَانَ","مِيقَٰتٗا"],"t":"The Day of Sorting has been appointed","l":"Inna Yawma Al-Fasli Kana Miqataan","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["yawma","(the) Day"],["l-faṣli","(of) the Judgment"],["kāna","is"],["mīqātan","an appointed time"]]},{"a":["يَوۡمَ","يُنفَخُ","فِي","ٱلصُّورِ","فَتَأۡتُونَ","أَفۡوَاجٗا"],"t":"The Day when the Trumpet is blown, and you will come in droves","l":"Yawma Yunfakhu Fi As-Suri Fata'tuna 'Afwajaan","w":[["yawma","(The) Day"],["yunfakhu","(in which) shall be blown"],["fī","in"],["l-ṣūri","the trumpet"],["fatatūna","and you will come forth"],["afwājan","(in) crowds"]]},{"a":["وَفُتِحَتِ","ٱلسَّمَآءُ","فَكَانَتۡ","أَبۡوَٰبٗا"],"t":"And the sky is opened up, and becomes gateways","l":"Wa Futihati As-Sama'u Fakanat 'Abwabaan","w":[["wafutiḥati","And is opened"],["l-samāu","the heaven"],["fakānat","and becomes"],["abwāban","gateways"]]},{"a":["وَسُيِّرَتِ","ٱلۡجِبَالُ","فَكَانَتۡ","سَرَابًا"],"t":"And the mountains are set in motion, and become a mirage","l":"Wa Suyyirati Al-Jibalu Fakanat Sarabaan","w":[["wasuyyirati","And are moved"],["l-jibālu","the mountains"],["fakānat","and become"],["sarāban","a mirage"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","جَهَنَّمَ","كَانَتۡ","مِرۡصَادٗا"],"t":"Hell is lying in ambush","l":"Inna Jahannama Kanat Mirsadaan","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["jahannama","Hell"],["kānat","is"],["mir'ṣādan","lying in wait"]]},{"a":["لِّلطَّـٰغِينَ","مَـَٔابٗا"],"t":"For the oppressors, a destination","l":"Lilttaghina Ma'abaan","w":[["lilṭṭāghīna","For the transgressors"],["maāban","a place of return"]]},{"a":["لَّـٰبِثِينَ","فِيهَآ","أَحۡقَابٗا"],"t":"Where they will remain for eons","l":"Labithina Fiha 'Ahqabaan","w":[["lābithīna","(They will) be remaining"],["fīhā","therein"],["aḥqāban","(for) ages"]]},{"a":["لَّا","يَذُوقُونَ","فِيهَا","بَرۡدٗا","وَلَا","شَرَابًا"],"t":"They will taste therein neither coolness, nor drink","l":"La Yadhuquna Fiha Bardaan Wa La Sharabaan","w":[["lā","Not"],["yadhūqūna","they will taste"],["fīhā","therein"],["bardan","coolness"],["walā","and not"],["sharāban","any drink"]]},{"a":["إِلَّا","حَمِيمٗا","وَغَسَّاقٗا"],"t":"Except boiling water, and freezing hail","l":"Illa Hamimaan Wa Ghassaqaan","w":[["illā","Except"],["ḥamīman","scalding water"],["waghassāqan","and purulence"]]},{"a":["جَزَآءٗ","وِفَاقًا"],"t":"A fitting requital","l":"Jaza'an Wifaqaan","w":[["jazāan","A recompense"],["wifāqan","appropriate"]]},{"a":["إِنَّهُمۡ","كَانُواْ","لَا","يَرۡجُونَ","حِسَابٗا"],"t":"For they were not anticipating any reckoning","l":"Innahum Kanu La Yarjuna Hisabaan","w":[["innahum","Indeed, they"],["kānū","were"],["lā","not"],["yarjūna","expecting"],["ḥisāban","an account"]]},{"a":["وَكَذَّبُواْ","بِـَٔايَٰتِنَا","كِذَّابٗا"],"t":"And they denied Our signs utterly","l":"Wa Kadhabu Bi'ayatina Kidhabaan","w":[["wakadhabū","And they denied"],["biāyātinā","Our Signs"],["kidhāban","(with) denial"]]},{"a":["وَكُلَّ","شَيۡءٍ","أَحۡصَيۡنَٰهُ","كِتَٰبٗا"],"t":"But We have enumerated everything in writing","l":"Wa Kulla Shay'in 'Ahsaynahu Kitabaan","w":[["wakulla","And every"],["shayin","thing"],["aḥṣaynāhu","We have enumerated it"],["kitāban","(in) a Book"]]},{"a":["فَذُوقُواْ","فَلَن","نَّزِيدَكُمۡ","إِلَّا","عَذَابًا"],"t":"So taste! We will increase you only in suffering","l":"Fadhuqu Falan Nazidakum 'Illa `Adhabaan","w":[["fadhūqū","So taste"],["falan","and never"],["nazīdakum","We will increase you"],["illā","except"],["ʿadhāban","(in) punishment"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","لِلۡمُتَّقِينَ","مَفَازًا"],"t":"But for the righteous there is triumph","l":"Inna Lilmuttaqina Mafazaan","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["lil'muttaqīna","for the righteous"],["mafāzan","(is) success"]]},{"a":["حَدَآئِقَ","وَأَعۡنَٰبٗا"],"t":"Gardens and vineyards","l":"Hada'iqa Wa 'A`nabaan","w":[["ḥadāiqa","Gardens"],["wa-aʿnāban","and grapevines"]]},{"a":["وَكَوَاعِبَ","أَتۡرَابٗا"],"t":"And splendid spouses, well matched","l":"Wa Kawa`iba 'Atrabaan","w":[["wakawāʿiba","And splendid companions"],["atrāban","well-matched"]]},{"a":["وَكَأۡسٗا","دِهَاقٗا"],"t":"And delicious drinks","l":"Wa Ka'saan Dihaqaan","w":[["wakasan","And a cup"],["dihāqan","full"]]},{"a":["لَّا","يَسۡمَعُونَ","فِيهَا","لَغۡوٗا","وَلَا","كِذَّـٰبٗا"],"t":"They will hear therein neither gossip, nor lies","l":"La Yasma`una Fiha Laghwan Wa La Kidhabaan","w":[["lā","Not"],["yasmaʿūna","they will hear"],["fīhā","therein"],["laghwan","any vain talk"],["walā","and not"],["kidhāban","any falsehood"]]},{"a":["جَزَآءٗ","مِّن","رَّبِّكَ","عَطَآءً","حِسَابٗا"],"t":"A reward from your Lord, a fitting gift","l":"Jaza'an Min Rabbika `Ata'an Hisabaan","w":[["jazāan","(As) a reward"],["min","from"],["rabbika","your Lord"],["ʿaṭāan","a gift"],["ḥisāban","(according to) account"]]},{"a":["رَّبِّ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ","وَمَا","بَيۡنَهُمَا","ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنِۖ","لَا","يَمۡلِكُونَ","مِنۡهُ","خِطَابٗا"],"t":"Lord of the heavens and the earth, and everything between them—The Most Merciful—none can argue with Him","l":"Rabbi As-Samawati Wa Al-'Arđi Wa Ma Baynahuma Ar-Rahmani La Yamlikuna Minhu Khitabaan","w":[["rabbi","Lord"],["l-samāwāti","(of) the heavens"],["wal-arḍi","and the earth"],["wamā","and whatever"],["baynahumā","(is) between both of them"],["l-raḥmāni","the Most Gracious"],["lā","not"],["yamlikūna","they have power"],["min'hu","from Him"],["khiṭāban","(to) address"]]},{"a":["يَوۡمَ","يَقُومُ","ٱلرُّوحُ","وَٱلۡمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","صَفّٗاۖ","لَّا","يَتَكَلَّمُونَ","إِلَّا","مَنۡ","أَذِنَ","لَهُ","ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنُ","وَقَالَ","صَوَابٗا"],"t":"On the Day when the Spirit and the angels stand in row. They will not speak, unless it be one permitted by the Most Merciful, and he will say what is right","l":"Yawma Yaqumu Ar-Ruhu Wa Al-Mala'ikatu Saffaan La Yatakallamuna 'Illa Man 'Adhina Lahu Ar-Rahmanu Wa Qala Sawabaan","w":[["yawma","(The) Day"],["yaqūmu","will stand"],["l-rūḥu","the Spirit"],["wal-malāikatu","and the Angels"],["ṣaffan","(in) rows"],["lā","not"],["yatakallamūna","they will speak"],["illā","except"],["man","(one) who "],["adhina","permits"],["lahu","[for] him"],["l-raḥmānu","the Most Gracious"],["waqāla","and he (will) say"],["ṣawāban","(what is) correct"]]},{"a":["ذَٰلِكَ","ٱلۡيَوۡمُ","ٱلۡحَقُّۖ","فَمَن","شَآءَ","ٱتَّخَذَ","إِلَىٰ","رَبِّهِۦ","مَـَٔابًا"],"t":"That is the Day of Reality. So whoever wills, let him take a way back to his Lord","l":"Dhalika Al-Yawmu Al-Haqqu Faman Sha'a Attakhadha 'Ila Rabbihi Ma'abaan","w":[["dhālika","That"],["l-yawmu","(is) the Day"],["l-ḥaqu","the True"],["faman","So whoever"],["shāa","wills"],["ittakhadha","let him take"],["ilā","towards"],["rabbihi","his Lord"],["maāban","a return"]]},{"a":["إِنَّآ","أَنذَرۡنَٰكُمۡ","عَذَابٗا","قَرِيبٗا","يَوۡمَ","يَنظُرُ","ٱلۡمَرۡءُ","مَا","قَدَّمَتۡ","يَدَاهُ","وَيَقُولُ","ٱلۡكَافِرُ","يَٰلَيۡتَنِي","كُنتُ","تُرَٰبَۢا"],"t":"We have warned you of a near punishment—the Day when a person will observe what his hands have produced, and the faithless will say, “O, I wish I were dust.”","l":"Inna 'Andharnakum `Adhabaan Qaribaan Yawma Yanzuru Al-Mar'u Ma Qaddamat Yadahu Wa Yaqulu Al-Kafiru Ya Laytani Kuntu Turabaan","w":[["innā","Indeed We"],["andharnākum","[We] have warned you"],["ʿadhāban","(of) a punishment"],["qarīban","near"],["yawma","(the) Day"],["yanẓuru","will see"],["l-maru","the man"],["mā","what"],["qaddamat","have sent forth"],["yadāhu","his hands"],["wayaqūlu","and will say"],["l-kāfiru","the disbeliever"],["yālaytanī","O I wish"],["kuntu","I were"],["turāban","dust"]]}]}